    {
      "number": 66,
      "category": "liezhuan",
      "title": "伍子胥列傳第六",
      "paragraph_id": "c-shiji-066-wu:p009",
      "count": 3,
      "raw_count": 3,
      "duplicate_count": 0,
      "counting_policy": "independent_fixed_witness_occurrences",
      "quote": "立三年，乃興師與伍胥、伯嚭伐楚，拔舒，遂禽故吳反二將軍。因欲至郢，將軍孫武曰：「民勞，未可，且待之。」乃歸。",
